      "text": "表径呢从四十、四十二点五到四十六都有，现在二级市场行情已经不到两万了，全金款可能也就三万不到。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "filename": "20260127_00004329_aaab_42_123.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_spk0/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_123.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "目前在我的了解里，适合大手腕的正装只有四款。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "filename": "20260127_00004329_aaab_42_4.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_spk0/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_4.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        0,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "在零零年到一零年之间大表径腕表其实才是炒得最凶的主流款式。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "filename": "20260127_00004329_aaab_42_56.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_spk0/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_56.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        0,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "颜值呢比较有特点不像主流潜水表的风格但是也挺厚挺大的，算是比较合适的一个大手腕选择。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "filename": "20260127_00004329_aaab_42_112.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_spk0/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_112.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "除了表特别厚和原装表带特别骚之外没有什么特别的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "filename": "20260127_00004329_aaab_42_29.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_spk0/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_29.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "两万块钱到四万块钱基本都有劳力士的鬼王我这里没有劳力士鬼王六到十万同价位还有一个宝珀的五零幺五。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "filename": "20260127_00004329_aaab_42_137.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_spk0/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_137.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "只有上海北京西安三个城市有专柜，比百达翡丽多一个，比理哈德米勒还要少。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "filename": "20260127_00004329_aaab_42_18.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_spk0/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_18.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "早卖也是卖晚卖也是卖，诸多品牌嘛就展望未来慢慢消化啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "filename": "20260127_00004329_aaab_42_73.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_spk0/20260127_00004329_aaab_42_73.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        0,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "有机会我们收一只过来专门做一期沛纳海。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "filename": "20260127_00004329_aaab_42_127.wav",
